{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.haruki.name",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她不太喜欢自己的名字",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.haruki.name",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.haruki.name",
    "idolId": "haruki",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "共演的休息室。她刚跟歌手打完招呼。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "今天请多关照，我是 283 的郁田はるき",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "请多指教……！",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "text": "对方愣了一下，说\"你就是？\"──像是想象中的人不太一样。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "…………呵呵，经常被弄错呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "托这个福，好像很容易被记住……！",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "はるき，有人给了点心，你吃吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "啊，谢谢您……！",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "不过还是忍一下吧。制作人先生，请……！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这、这样啊……我现在也先算了──",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……那个。刚才，对方吓了一大跳吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "啊……常有的事。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "从小就这样──经常被笑，也经常被拿来开玩笑",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "所以，其实我不太喜欢自己的名字──",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "不过，已经习惯了。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "其实，并没有习惯吧？从小就这样的话，更是──",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……觉得讨厌也可以。说出来也可以。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………抱歉。如果你真的不在意，就是多管闲事了────",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "不是的。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "……谢谢您。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "第一次，有人这么说。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "那个，我可以……再慢慢说一点吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。什么时候都可以。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
